SUMMARY:TDRR #1 Weekend Short Ride\, Donegal Loop Ride (17R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Debbie Walburn\n\n
 Celebrate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribute to
  the event. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and Rid
 ing our Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Rose P
 age](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&
 module_id=326153)\n\nTdRR ride details & start location are on the [TdRR S
 chedule](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257
 148&module_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://routes
 .lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/dh-donegal-loop-ride-17r/)\n\nTour de Red Rose 
 & LBC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes an
 d Weather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!for
 um/lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelmet
 s are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic 
 repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Meet
 up Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is 
 your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikecl
 ub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984
 ) and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.asp
 x?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://
 lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3150287
 56/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260530T195210Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260530T195210Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
